{"c":[{"id":"e3e2ae3d8390c6b7","sum":"OWNER_NOTE_CHARS is 0 behind TODO(INT1) (grep it to restore 2,000). Onboarding's privacyLine reads bundled PrivacyPromise.txt (nil under swift run/xctest; tests inject one); CARET_VERIFY_PRIVACY_RESOURCE refuses an app whose copy is missing or differs.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261008T030901Z-f494e5b78b4262d5","text":"INT1 (v2/int1): OWNER_NOTE_CHARS is 0 behind TODO(INT1) until HA2's allotment is re-expressed on the output-based ledger; the tests that need it are skipped or floored with TODO(INT1). grep TODO(INT1) to restore 2,000.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261008T053436Z-ced2cc8130be00ef","text":"Onboarding promise: PermissionsScreen.privacyLine reads bundle PrivacyPromise.txt (nil under swift run/xctest); renders and tests inject their own PrivacyPromise. CARET_VERIFY_PRIVACY_RESOURCE: gate refuses a finished app whose copy is missing, empty or not PRIVACY_PROMISE.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"3a15d551c65db7c1","sum":"Elapsed-time candidate cuts made the canned Ask oracle load-sensitive. Scope-ask stand-ins use builders.scopeLabel, never wording regexes. An askAnswer with no picks is valid only beside a question's filling labels.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261008T080402Z-28411e2e4fbdeba1","text":"realfill-asks canned oracle: fill's 15 ms wall-clock candidate budget (GENERATOR_BUDGET_MS) flips a single run's Ask right->refused about 1 in 20 under load; rerun or loop one Ask before calling an oracle drop a regression (G35 b31-04, ask-17).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261008T080402Z-5b6ab755f2bbf6d7","text":"Scope-ask stand-ins read the field label with test/builders.ts scopeLabel (wording: Field: \"<label>\". Control: ...); never regex the wording in a test. An askAnswer with no picks is valid only beside a question's filling labels.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
